# Moziketo Wave (FastAPI)

Greenfield backend for موزیکتو. **Not WordPress.**

## Server — moziketo-hand

- SSH: `ssh moziketo` (deploy@95.38.191.28)
- Deploy path: `/opt/moziketo/wave` or `/opt/moziketo` compose
- Agent may SSH, docker compose, edit nginx under `/opt/moziketo/nginx/conf.d`

## Stack

FastAPI · PostgreSQL · Redis · SQLAlchemy async · Alembic · Docker · OpenAPI at `/openapi.json`

## Pairing

- Frontend: **moziketo-web** (Next.js) consumes this API
- CORS: `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` origins in `.env`

## CI/CD

GitHub Actions: lint (ruff) + pytest + docker build on `main`.
Deploy: SSH to moziketo-hand, `docker compose up -d --build wave`.

## Rules

- Conventional commits; commit only when user asks
- OpenAPI-first — keep `/docs` and schemas in sync
- No secrets in git
